// # Opm Docs Index — Anchor for Agents
//
// Logline: Index of the user-facing docs for opm.
//
// Setup: Per-package docs (RFC-0005). They travel with the package when opm ships independently.
//
// Beats:
//   1. INSTALL.oot — how to install opm and how it relates to the rest of the toolchain.
//   2. versioning.oot — how the VERSION contract works (opm version, ooda compat range, api_surface check).
//   3. cli.oot — user-facing CLI reference for `ooda opm <subcommand>`.
//   4. MANIFEST.oot — the package manifest format: fields, types, required vs optional, examples.
//   5. REGISTRY.oot — how the openOODA registry works: CAS hashes, capability declarations, search, install.

import "INSTALL.oot";
import "versioning.oot";
import "cli.oot";
import "MANIFEST.oot";
import "REGISTRY.oot";
